{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "sedimentation_jh2010_flux_D_lev_interior",
    "description": "INTERIOR layers k = 3 .. NLEV-2 of the Juang & Hong (2010) sedimentation divergence on column_nonuniform_1d, in the dt -> 0 limit of WRF WSM6's forward semi-Lagrangian fallout (nislfv_rain_plm): (d/dz (W q))[k] = (F[k+1] - F[k]) / dz[k], where F[j] is the flux through the LOWER face of layer j, F[j] = W_face[j] q_face[j], given by sedimentation_jh2010_face_flux. The face velocity is sedimentation_jh2010_face_velocity (third-order, four layers W[j-2..j+1]); the face value is taken from the UPWIND side, which for a downward face speed is the lower-face value of layer j (sedimentation_jh2010_face_value, the monotone average-slope reconstruction over q[j-1..j+1]) and, where the third-order speed overshoots upward, the upper-face value of layer j-1 (over q[j-2..j]). Layer k therefore reads W, q and dz over k-2 .. k+2 (five layers); both faces of every layer in this range are interior faces (3 <= j <= NLEV-1), which is what bounds the range. Same signs and the same velocity-inside-the-operator convention as sedimentation_upwind1_flux_D_lev_interior: q is the layer-centred falling density, W = -v_t <= 0 the layer-centred signed velocity along +lev, and a consuming model writes dq/dt = -D(W*q, wrt: lev).",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:stencil",
      "family:finite_volume",
      "grid:column_nonuniform_1d",
      "op:advection",
      "order:2",
      "stencil_width:5",
      "scheme:semi_lagrangian_plm_limit"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Juang, H.-M. H., & Hong, S.-Y. (2010). Forward semi-Lagrangian advection with mass conservation and positive definiteness for falling hydrometeors. Monthly Weather Review, 138(5), 1778-1791.",
        "doi": "10.1175/2009MWR3109.1"
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    {"ref": "../grid.esm"},
    {"ref": "sedimentation_jh2010_face_flux.esm"}
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "sedimentation_jh2010_flux_D_lev_interior": {
      "params": ["q", "W"],
      "body": {
        "op": "faq",
        "output_idx": ["k"],
        "args": ["q", "W"],
        "ranges": {
          "k": [3, {"op": "-", "args": ["NLEV", 2]}]
        },
        "expr": {
          "op": "/",
          "args": [
            {
              "op": "-",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "apply_expression_template",
                  "args": [],
                  "name": "sedimentation_jh2010_face_flux",
                  "bindings": {
                    "Wm2": {"op": "index", "args": ["W", {"op": "-", "args": ["k", 1]}]},
                    "Wm1": {"op": "index", "args": ["W", "k"]},
                    "W0": {"op": "index", "args": ["W", {"op": "+", "args": ["k", 1]}]},
                    "Wp1": {"op": "index", "args": ["W", {"op": "+", "args": ["k", 2]}]},
                    "qm2": {"op": "index", "args": ["q", {"op": "-", "args": ["k", 1]}]},
                    "qm1": {"op": "index", "args": ["q", "k"]},
                    "q0": {"op": "index", "args": ["q", {"op": "+", "args": ["k", 1]}]},
                    "qp1": {"op": "index", "args": ["q", {"op": "+", "args": ["k", 2]}]},
                    "dzm2": {"op": "index", "args": ["dz", {"op": "-", "args": ["k", 1]}]},
                    "dzm1": {"op": "index", "args": ["dz", "k"]},
                    "dz0": {"op": "index", "args": ["dz", {"op": "+", "args": ["k", 1]}]},
                    "dzp1": {"op": "index", "args": ["dz", {"op": "+", "args": ["k", 2]}]}
                  }
                },
                {
                  "op": "apply_expression_template",
                  "args": [],
                  "name": "sedimentation_jh2010_face_flux",
                  "bindings": {
                    "Wm2": {"op": "index", "args": ["W", {"op": "-", "args": ["k", 2]}]},
                    "Wm1": {"op": "index", "args": ["W", {"op": "-", "args": ["k", 1]}]},
                    "W0": {"op": "index", "args": ["W", "k"]},
                    "Wp1": {"op": "index", "args": ["W", {"op": "+", "args": ["k", 1]}]},
                    "qm2": {"op": "index", "args": ["q", {"op": "-", "args": ["k", 2]}]},
                    "qm1": {"op": "index", "args": ["q", {"op": "-", "args": ["k", 1]}]},
                    "q0": {"op": "index", "args": ["q", "k"]},
                    "qp1": {"op": "index", "args": ["q", {"op": "+", "args": ["k", 1]}]},
                    "dzm2": {"op": "index", "args": ["dz", {"op": "-", "args": ["k", 2]}]},
                    "dzm1": {"op": "index", "args": ["dz", {"op": "-", "args": ["k", 1]}]},
                    "dz0": {"op": "index", "args": ["dz", "k"]},
                    "dzp1": {"op": "index", "args": ["dz", {"op": "+", "args": ["k", 1]}]}
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {"op": "index", "args": ["dz", "k"]}
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
